---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Leadership & Impact"
  description="WeCareDXB — the student-led social impact organization founded by Riva Tulpule in 2017, spanning e-waste recycling, a sustainability edu-fest, menstrual hygiene awareness, and disaster relief campaigns across the UAE and India."
>
  <!-- SECTION 1: INTRODUCTION -->
  <section class="border-b border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-cream-dark)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-16">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <img
          src="/images/leadership/wecaredxb-cover.jpg"
          alt="WeCareDXB logo — a plant icon over the tagline 'Together let's make a difference'"
          class="h-20 w-32 rounded-md border border-[var(--color-border)] object-cover sm:h-24 sm:w-40"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="font-serif-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-rust)]">
            Leadership &amp; Impact
          </p>
          <h1 class="mt-1 font-serif-display text-4xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)] sm:text-5xl">
            WeCareDXB
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-1 text-base italic text-[var(--color-brown)]">"Together, let's make a difference."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/90">
        I founded WeCareDXB in 2017 as a student-led organization focused on sustainability, public health, and
        community support. What began as a small effort has grown into a multi-initiative platform engaging
        students, schools, and organizations across the UAE and India.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-brown)]">Founder · May 2017 – Present · Dubai, UAE</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 2: THE PEOPLE BEHIND WECAREDXB -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 pt-10 sm:px-8">
    <img
      src="/images/leadership/edu-fest-stage-group.jpg"
      alt="WeCareDXB volunteers on stage with the Sustainability Edu-Fest trophy, alongside partner representatives"
      class="w-full rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] object-cover"
      style="aspect-ratio: 1800/684;"
    />
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]/60">WeCareDXB volunteers at the Sustainability Edu-Fest.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 3: IMPACT AT A GLANCE -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-10 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6 sm:grid-cols-4">
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-brown)] sm:text-3xl">300+</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-snug text-[var(--color-ink)]/75">volunteers</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-brown)] sm:text-3xl">34</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-snug text-[var(--color-ink)]/75">schools in our ongoing network</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-brown)] sm:text-3xl">360+</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-snug text-[var(--color-ink)]/75">students from 46 schools at the inaugural Edu-Fest</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="font-serif-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-brown)] sm:text-3xl">50+ tonnes</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-snug text-[var(--color-ink)]/75">of e-waste recycled to date</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 4: MY ROLE -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 pb-10 sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="font-serif-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">My Role</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
      I founded WeCareDXB, built its 300+ volunteer network, and coordinated school outreach and partnerships across
      the UAE and India. Alongside our volunteers and partner organizations, I helped plan and carry out each of the
      initiatives below.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 5: PROJECTS & INITIATIVES -->
  <section class="border-y border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-cream-dark)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8">
      <h2 class="font-serif-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Projects &amp; Initiatives</h2>

      <div class="mt-8 space-y-10">
        <!-- 1. E-Waste — photo left / text right -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
          <img
            src="/images/leadership/ewaste-recycling.jpg"
            alt="Riva seated in front of a large collection of electronic waste gathered for recycling"
            class="w-full rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] object-cover"
            style="aspect-ratio: 980/551;"
          />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">E-Waste Recycling Initiative</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
              Launched in 2017 to address the improper disposal of electronic waste. We partnered with Enviroserve to
              collect e-waste from communities across the UAE, recycling 50+ tonnes responsibly to date.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Edu-Fest — text only, compact -->
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-paper)] p-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Sustainability Edu-Fest</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
            Co-hosted with Enviroserve and GEMS Modern Academy, the inaugural Edu-Fest brought together 360+ students
            from 46 schools for five sustainability-focused competitions — e-waste recycling, research, art, video,
            and photography — judged by a symposium and awards ceremony in May 2022. Industry leaders from Stanford
            University, Enviroserve, Samsung Gulf, Chalhoub Group, and GEMS Education took part, with Samsung and
            Chalhoub Group sponsoring awards.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Menstrual Hygiene — text left / photo right -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
          <div class="sm:order-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Menstrual Hygiene Awareness Campaign</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
              Ran awareness sessions and distribution drives in rural India, supporting 700+ girls with access to
              menstrual hygiene products and education — and working to break stigma at the community level.
            </p>
          </div>
          <img
            src="/images/leadership/menstrual-hygiene-campaign.jpg"
            alt="Riva handing menstrual hygiene supplies to a group of girls in rural India"
            class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[360px] rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] object-cover sm:order-2"
            style="aspect-ratio: 230/174;"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Kindness Packs — photo left / text right -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
          <img
            src="/images/leadership/kindness-packs.jpg"
            alt="A large group of WeCareDXB volunteers and blue-collar workers gathered for the Kindness Packs distribution"
            class="w-full rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] object-cover"
            style="aspect-ratio: 1116/567;"
          />
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">COVID Kindness Packs Campaign</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
              Distributed essential grocery kits to 200 blue-collar workers affected by the pandemic, in partnership
              with OMPK, a local Dubai grocery store that supplied the dry grocery items.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Konkan Flood Relief — text left / photo right -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-6 sm:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
          <div class="sm:order-1">
            <h3 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Konkan Flood Relief Campaign</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
              Organized donation drives that collected and distributed 2.5 tonnes of relief material to communities
              affected by flooding in the Konkan region.
            </p>
          </div>
          <img
            src="/images/leadership/konkan-flood-relief.jpg"
            alt="Four WeCareDXB volunteers wearing masks and green WeCareDXB shirts during the Konkan flood relief effort"
            class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[360px] rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] object-cover sm:order-2"
            style="aspect-ratio: 280/190;"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 6: PARTNERSHIPS & RECOGNITION -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Partnerships</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
          Enviroserve, Samsung Gulf, Chalhoub Group, GEMS Education, and OMPK.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Recognition</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
          <li>Eco-Hero Award (USA)</li>
          <li>Diana Award (UK)</li>
          <li>Hamdan Award (UAE)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 7: CLOSING -->
  <section class="border-t border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-cream-dark)]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-8">
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink)]/85">
        Today, my sister <strong class="text-[var(--color-charcoal)]">Risha Tulpule</strong> is continuing WeCareDXB's
        work, carrying the organization's legacy forward and expanding its reach.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
